      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THAT'S OKAY (8) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 17.68 beating Pure Mouse. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Expected to measure up again. GUNNELL GIRL (1) showed good early burn and was there until turning but swamped late to finish 6th at this track in a Grade 4. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Deserves plenty of respect. TRALEE LUNA (2) turned spotting a big start finishing fifth (17.87) last time in a NG at this track. Has a good record here at this journey. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Has the ability to give this a shake. KARLI MULWEE (5) was unplaced here last start but gets her chance to atone.",
